      "content": "<p>The metal ion (in gaseous state) with lowest spin-only magnetic moment value is :</p>",
      "options": [
        {
          "identifier": "A",
          "content": "V<sup>2+</sup>"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "B",
          "content": "Ni<sup>2+</sup>"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "C",
          "content": "Cr<sup>2+</sup>"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "D",
          "content": "Fe<sup>2+</sup>"
        }
      ],
      "correct_options": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": "<table style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;min-width:460px\">\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th></th>\n    <th>Valence shell configuration</th>\n    <th>Unpaired electrons</th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td>V<sup>2+</sup></td>\n    <td>3d<sup>3</sup>4s<sup>0</sup></td>\n    <td>n = 3</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Ni<sup>2+</sup></td>\n    <td>3d<sup>8</sup>4s<sup>0</sup></td>\n    <td>n = 2</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Cr<sup>2+</sup></td>\n    <td>3d<sup>4</sup>4s<sup>0</sup></td>\n    <td>n = 4</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Fe<sup>2+</sup></td>\n    <td>3d<sup>6</sup>4s<sup>0</sup></td>\n    <td>n = 4</td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><br/><br/>\nSince Ni<sup>2+</sup> has least number of unpaired electrons.\nHence Ni<sup>2+</sup> will have lowest spin only magnetic\nmoment Value."
